#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-max-error.md:1
#: 5830c4d2176d4b9e8393e66af1654ab6
msgid "查找最大误差点（Find Max Error Point）"
msgstr "Find Max Error Point"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-max-error.md:3
#: c63f350fc6b1410394bd948e2792f00c
msgid "作用与适用场景"
msgstr "Purpose and use cases"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-max-error.md:5
#: 2f6707a69fa74a978482f039bb976004
msgid ""
"从当前图对应的误差指标中选出最大的前 `N` 个结构，用于快速定位最需要复核的标签、 异常构型或训练集缺口。结果依赖当前子图，切换 "
"energy、force 或 virial 后含义不同。"
msgstr ""
"Select the top `N` structures by the error metric represented in the "
"current plot. Use this to locate labels, anomalous configurations, or "
"training-set gaps that most need review. The meaning depends on the "
"active subplot and changes between energy, force, and virial views."

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-max-error.md:8
#: 0f09203ef6154e57999be504881bda1e
msgid "排名原理"
msgstr "Ranking Method"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-max-error.md:10
#: c338c30676714cd483c081928dd410f0
#
msgid "当前图中 x 轴是参考值（通常为 DFT），y 轴是 NEP 预测值。对图中第 $i$ 行数据， 程序按当前子图包含的分量计算绝对误差和："
msgstr "In the current plot, x is the reference value (usually from DFT) and y is the NEP prediction. For row $i$, the program sums the absolute errors over the components shown by the active subplot:"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-max-error.md:13
#: fd62e2ce6302452ba4aeebc1e085214a
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"e_i=\\sum_{k\\in C}\\left|y_{ik}-x_{ik}\\right|,\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"e_i=\\sum_{k\\in C}\\left|y_{ik}-x_{ik}\\right|,\n"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-max-error.md:17
#: 1187b59565b34b4e9867a5a789dbc76e
msgid ""
"其中 $C$ 是当前图实际参与比较的列。例如能量图通常每个结构只有一行；力图中一个结构 会有多个原子行。程序先按 $e_i$ "
"从大到小排序，再把行映射回结构编号并去重，直到得到 前 $N$ 个不同结构。因此在力图中，它回答的是“至少有一个原子分量误差很大的结构”， "
"不是按结构平均 RMSE 排名。"
msgstr ""
"Here $C$ is the set of columns actually compared in the current plot. An "
"energy plot usually has one row per structure, whereas a force plot has "
"several atomic rows for one structure. Rows are sorted by decreasing "
"$e_i$, mapped back to structure indices, and deduplicated until `N` "
"distinct structures remain. In a force plot, this therefore finds "
"structures with at least one large atomic-component error; it is not a "
"ranking by per-structure mean RMSE."

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-max-error.md:22
#: 9cfced49cfba442fada6227c32709896
msgid "参数与执行结果"
msgstr "Parameters and execution result"

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:5668
#: 29d0cff279434ac8a54de07cf841abf1
msgid "输入控件：`结构数`（整数 `N`）。"
msgstr "Control: `Number of structures` (integer `N`)."

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:5669
#: 670ae15b9cda4b77a8754dff5f026287
msgid "默认值：`10`；修改后会记住上次输入的数量。"
msgstr "Default: `10`; the last value you entered is remembered."

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:5670
#: 7f505617ef7a48bbb845e27d391f6b78
msgid "执行结果：选中当前轴上误差最大的前 `N` 个结构。"
msgstr ""
"Result: select the top `N` structures with the largest errors on the "
"current axes."

